>
  <p>The porch is the handshake of the house, and it takes a beating: foot traffic every day, water off the roof line, and freeze-thaw all winter. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> repairs, resurfaces and pours concrete porches across Toronto and the GTA.</p>

  <p>Porch problems usually start at the base or the joint where the porch meets the house. Settlement opens a gap, water gets in, frost pries it wider, and within a few winters the surface is spalling and the edge is crumbling. When we rebuild, we fix the base first so the same cycle does not start over.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our concrete porch service</h2>
  <p>Every porch job is priced as a complete package in a written quote:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>An honest assessment</strong>: resurface if the structure is sound, rebuild if it is not</li>
    <li><strong>Excavation and a compacted base</strong> that addresses settlement</li>
    <li><strong>Forming to the right height</strong> so the porch meets your door threshold properly</li>
    <li><strong>Pour and finish</strong>, broom texture for grip</li>
    <li><strong>Steps and landings</strong> where the entrance needs them</li>
    <li><strong>Full cleanup</strong> and curing guidance before we leave</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Porches, steps and parging in one visit</h2>
  <p>A porch job often pairs naturally with new <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a> and a fresh <a href="/services/parging/">parge coat</a> on the porch base or foundation wall beside it. One crew, one quote, one schedule, and the whole entrance looks finished at once.</p>

  <h2>Why homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of local experience and hundreds of concrete jobs across Toronto. We give you a straight answer on repair versus rebuild, a written price, and a schedule we keep.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We pour porches across the GTA, from Toronto to <a href="/locations/vaughan/">Vaughan</a> and <a href="/locations/whitby/">Whitby</a>. See every area on our <a href="/locations/">service areas</a> page.</p>
